## iOS CarPlay + system media controls

### CarPlay UI

Delegate:
- `src/Bible.Alarm/Platforms/iOS/Services/CarPlay/CarPlaySceneDelegate.cs`

Behavior:
- when CarPlay connects, sets a root `CPListTemplate` listing schedules
- pulls schedule list from Fluxor state via helper:
  - `CarPlayScheduleHelper.LoadScheduleStateItemsFromState()`
- tapping a schedule triggers playback through:
  - `CarPlayPlaybackHandler.HandleScheduleItemClicked(scheduleId)`

Important note in code:
- CarPlay requires the `com.apple.developer.carplay-audio` entitlement; without it, the delegate will never be called.

### Now Playing integration

Now Playing manager:
- `src/Bible.Alarm/Platforms/iOS/Services/Media/iOSNowPlayingInfoManager.cs`

Key behaviors:
- updates `MPNowPlayingInfoCenter` for lock screen / control center / CarPlay
- intentionally preserves artwork (never clears it) to avoid "empty lock screen" visuals

The app also wires Remote Command Center to support play/pause/next/prev/seek from the system UI.
